    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        104.793701171875,
        441.5372009277344,
        123.59259796142578
      ],
      "text": "When the government imposed restrictions on the use of paper.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        136.5320587158203,
        112.34269714355469,
        156.033447265625
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.63470458984375,
        519.8544311523438,
        195.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "Yeah, but that was only in the UK. In the USA, programmes, or rather playbills,\ncontinued to be published in the same format.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        208.0520477294922,
        104.5427017211914,
        227.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        228.1547088623047,
        494.84747314453125,
        267.3934326171875
      ],
      "text": "While here in the UK, programmes became merely a single sheet of paper\nfolded to create four MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        267.87469482421875,
        513.7416381835938,
        326.3926086425781
      ],
      "text": "What I don’t really get is that after the war they didn’t go back to being more\nthan one sheet or change in any way for over 25 years. I know there were\npaper shortages after the war, but only for five or ten years.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        339.33203125,
        104.5427017211914,
        358.83343505859375
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        359.4346923828125,
        122.33805847167969,
        378.2336120605469
      ],
      "text": "Strange.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        423.0346984863281,
        482.8927001953125,
        461.2337341308594
      ],
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at\nquestions 27 to 30. Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        506.4920654296875,
        112.34269714355469,
        525.9934692382812
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        526.5936889648438,
        490.768798828125,
        565.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "I got some pictures of programmes we could include on the slides for our\npresentation.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        578.1320190429688,
        104.5427017211914,
        597.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        598.2347412109375,
        449.2176208496094,
        617.0336303710938
      ],
      "text": "I found a couple too Maya. Let go through and see what we think.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        629.85205078125,
        112.34269714355469,
        649.3534545898438
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        649.834716796875,
        371.69921875,
        668.6336059570312
      ],
      "text": "Um oh this is an old one for a play called Ruey Blass.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        681.571044921875,
        104.5427017211914,
        701.0724487304688
      ],
